## Scope and grade
# Demonstrated at rung 4: a REAL gphoto2 consumer (gp_file_save) dereferenced
# a device-directed file->data pointer and wrote chosen bytes to a host file,
# with a matched guards=0 abort control and fixed/safe/zero controls. Still
# lab-assisted: the pointer value is injected by the probe (lab-known
# address), the canary and saved registers come from gdb, the victim is
# placed inside the lab vusb hook, and replies are synthetic. No USB bus,
# wire, remote request, device-only canary recovery, command execution or
# witness replay. Rung 5 UNKNOWN.
